    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bezalel and Oholiab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"See, I have chosen Bezalel son of Uri, the son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I have filled him with the Spirit of God, with wisdom, with understanding, with knowledge and with all kinds of skills—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to make artistic designs for work in gold, silver and bronze,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to cut and set stones, to work in wood, and to engage in all kinds of crafts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover, I have appointed Oholiab son of Ahisamak, of the tribe of Dan, to help him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "EXO 31:6"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh",
        "vid": "EXO 31:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I have given ability to all the skilled workers to make everything I have commanded you:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"the tent of meeting,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "EXO 31:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the ark of the covenant law with the atonement cover on it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "EXO 31:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and all the other furnishings of the tent—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the table and its articles,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EXO 31:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the pure gold lampstand and all its accessories,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EXO 31:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the altar of incense,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the altar of burnt offering and all its utensils,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EXO 31:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the basin with its stand—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and also the woven garments,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EXO 31:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "both the sacred garments for Aaron the priest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EXO 31:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the garments for his sons when they serve as priests,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the anointing oil and fragrant incense for the Holy Place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "EXO 31:11"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf",
        "vid": "EXO 31:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"They are to make them just as I commanded you.\"",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Sabbath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Say to the Israelites, 'You must observe my Sabbaths. This will be a sign between me and you for the generations to come, so you may know that I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", who makes you holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Observe the Sabbath, because it is holy to you. Anyone who desecrates it is to be put to death; those who do any work on that day must be cut off from their people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For six days work is to be done, but the seventh day is a day of sabbath rest, holy to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Whoever does any work on the Sabbath day is to be put to death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Israelites are to observe the Sabbath, celebrating it for the generations to come as a lasting covenant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be a sign between me and the Israelites forever, for in six days the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made the heavens and the earth, and on the seventh day he rested and was refreshed.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "finished speaking to Moses on Mount Sinai, he gave him the two tablets of the covenant law, the tablets of stone inscribed by the finger of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
